[2022-03-14T11:43:55+08:00][sql] UPDATE `carver_article`  SET `article_id` = 62 , `article_title` = '解决MAC安装HOMEBREW后报错-BASH: BREW: COMMAND NOT FOUND的方法' , `article_desc` = '找到了解决MAC安装HOMEBREW后报错-BASH: BREW: COMMAND NOT FOUND的方法' , `article_content` = '<p>今天Mac一顿猛虎操作才解决了这个问题：</p><p><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\"><span style=\"font-family: raleway, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit;\">事情过程</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">事情是这样的，一开始我的macOS想要安装ncdu，但是，输入<code style=\"margin: 0px 0.25em; border: 1px solid rgba(160, 160, 160, 0.3); font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-family: Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border-radius: 2px;\">brew install ncdu</code>，结果出现<code style=\"margin: 0px 0.25em; border: 1px solid rgba(160, 160, 160, 0.3); font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-family: Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border-radius: 2px;\">-bash: brew: command not found</code></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">然后我就发现我没有安装homebrew，兴致勃勃去官网一看，复制链接：<br><code style=\"margin: 0px 0.25em; border: 1px solid rgba(160, 160, 160, 0.3); font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-family: Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border-radius: 2px;\">/bin/bash -c \"$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/master/install.sh)”</code></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">but，报错，<code style=\"margin: 0px 0.25em; border: 1px solid rgba(160, 160, 160, 0.3); font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-family: Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border-radius: 2px;\">curl: (7) Failed to connect to raw.githubusercontent.com port 443: Connection refused</code></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">然后，我就去查原因。</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">基本以下的雷我都踩过，如果想直接找到解决问题的方法，直接空投最后</p><h3 style=\"margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 22px; line-height: 30px; font-family: raleway, Helvetica, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">查看看原因</h3><h5 style=\"margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 18px; line-height: 26px; font-family: raleway, Helvetica, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\"><a id=\"1_18\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow,noindex\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; transition: color 0.2s ease 0s, border-bottom-color 0.2s ease 0s; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>排雷1</h5><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">网上基本上搜出来，排在前面的结果大多数都是说</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">首先确保当前在~目录然后</p><pre class=\"prettyprint\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 8px 16px 6px 56px; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-family: Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(40, 44, 52); overflow-y: hidden; position: relative; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><code class=\"prism language-bash has-numbering\" style=\"margin: 0px 0.25em; padding: 0.5em; border: 1px solid rgba(160, 160, 160, 0.3); font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-family: Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(40, 44, 52); display: block; overflow-x: auto; color: rgb(171, 178, 191); border-radius: 4px; white-space: pre; overflow-wrap: normal; text-size-adjust: none;\"><span class=\"token function\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(97, 174, 238); font-variant-ligatures: normal !important; font-variant-numeric: normal !important; font-variant-east-asian: normal !important; font-stretch: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; font-family: Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif !important;\">sudo</span> vim .bash_profile
</code><ul class=\"pre-numbering\" style=\"padding-top: 8px; padding-bottom: 8px; border: 0px; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; position: absolute; width: 48px; top: 0px; left: 0px; text-align: right;\"><li style=\"padding-right: 8px; padding-left: 8px; border-width: 0px 1px 0px 0px; border-top-style: initial; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: initial; border-right-color: rgb(197, 197, 197); border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; font: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">1</li></ul></pre><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; border: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;SF UI Text&quot;, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(244, 244, 244);\">接着添加类似于windows的环境变量</p><pre class=\"prettyprint\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 8px 16px 6px 56px; border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-family: Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(40, 44, 52); overflow-y: hidden; position: relative; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><code class=\"prism language-bash has-numbering\" style=\"margin: 0px 0.25em; padding: 0.5em; border: 1px solid rgba(160, 160, 160, 0.3); font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-family: Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(40, 44, 52); display: block; overflow-x: auto; color: rgb(171, 178, 191); border-radius: 4px; white-space: pre; overflow-wrap: normal; text-size-adjust: none;\"><span class=\"token function\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(97, 174, 238); font-variant-ligatures: normal !important; font-variant-numeric: normal !important; font-variant-east-asian: normal !important; font-stretch: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; font-family: Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif !important;\">export</span> PATH<span class=\"token operator\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(102, 153, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal !important; font-variant-numeric: normal !important; font-variant-east-asian: normal !important; font-stretch: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; font-family: Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif !important;\">=</span>/usr/local/bin:<span class=\"token variable\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(238, 153, 0); font-variant-ligatures: normal !important; font-variant-numeric: normal !important; font-variant-east-asian: normal !important; font-stretch: normal !important; line-height: normal !important; font-family: Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif !important;\">$PATH</span>
